sha256":"2f16be2f21bfc7b87aeaa68d783effa00d185fd00c65014d0a28ad7df3b39769","url":"https://github.com/devmil/gitlama/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.60-61/GitLama-0.1.0-beta.60-61-linux-x86_64.AppImage"},{"architecture":"x86_64","bytes":31376134,"file":"GitLama-0.1.0-beta.60-61-linux-x86_64.tar.gz","format":"tar.gz","minimum_system":"glibc 2.35 and Git 2.39","platform":"linux","sha256":"1ad69a99ecb0976a20effc9c5217ab62f2e86a8514c3d1273ecd8ba4c5d164ac","url":"https://github.com/devmil/gitlama/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.60-61/GitLama-0.1.0-beta.60-61-linux-x86_64.tar.gz"},{"architecture":"arm64","bytes":33454430,"file":"GitLama-0.1.0-beta.60-61-macos-arm64.dmg","format":"dmg","minimum_system":"macOS 13.0 and Git 2.39","platform":"macos","sha256":"d6a9de7f8505b7fe88c4703e95f0f720e12967d6e1bc7291714c6b743df1ed92","update_signature":"ddspds0oOf8ZMnm8j+TTvwsEPYngLPp0ksCvVhIsQe5eR/i2jQJhWTtW0s/UywGVXfuqrngO5polzMDzuYKSAA==","url":"https://github.com/devmil/gitlama/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.60-61/GitLama-0.1.0-beta.60-61-macos-arm64.dmg"},{"architecture":"x86_64","bytes":27295744,"file":"GitLama-0.1.0-beta.60-61-windows-x86_64.msi","format":"msi","minimum_system":"Windows 10 version 1809 and Git 2.39","platform":"windows","sha256":"61db80b52a31b3eb8fa2494f95be3310a635e39e602ad2c2936e6b066bb7e132","url":"https://github.com/devmil/gitlama/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.60-61/GitLama-0.1.0-beta.60-61-windows-x86_64.msi"},{"architecture":"x86_64","bytes":31418382,"file":"gitlama-0.1.0-beta.60-61.x86_64.rpm","format":"rpm","minimum_system":"glibc 2.35 and Git 2.39","platform":"linux","sha256":"9c116f2c55886e8eb7cb5e7051ff6ee80ab0840a8f2411c23c7d15ffa90eb9e2","url":"https://github.com/devmil/gitlama/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.60-61/gitlama-0.1.0-beta.60-61.x86_64.rpm"},{"architecture":"x86_64","bytes":31410042,"file":"gitlama_0.1.0-beta.60-61_amd64.deb","format":"deb","minimum_system":"glibc 2.35 and Git 2.39","platform":"linux","sha256":"3c5fc9238e569da83776cd587feb4864ff5fffbec4ae39b00d57f21abde53e8a","url":"https://github.com/devmil/gitlama/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.60-61/gitlama_0.1.0-beta.60-61_amd64.deb"}],"build":61,"channel":"beta","notes":["Files GitLama shows as binary can now be shown as text anyway with Show as text, in the Changes and History diffs and in the History file preview. This helps with text files Git mistakes for binary; for real binary files the result is unreadable. Lines of such a file cannot be staged one by one. Hosts receive a new GitLama helper.","SSH destinations now accept `user@host` in the Add host form, `--remote` and `ssh://` links, using existing SSH keys and agent authentication.","When a host already has the maximum number of repositories open, GitLama now explains the limit and asks you to close another repository tab on that host before trying again.","Opening a worktree on a host that already has the maximum number of repositories open now shows the same explanation in the worktree's tab.","You can now have up to 16 repositories open per host instead of 8. Hosts receive an updated GitLama helper the next time they connect.","Open a repository on a host from the terminal or another app with `gitlama --remote <host> <path>` or `gitlama ssh://<host>/<path>`, using an SSH alias, hostname or `user@host`. If no saved host matches yet, GitLama offers to add it first.","History now also shows whether CI passes on your repository's main branch, next to the main branch's chip."],"tag":"v0.1.0-beta.60-61","version":"0.1.0-beta.60"},{"assets":[{"architecture":"x86_64","bytes":29997560,"file":"GitLama-0.1.0-beta.59-60-linux-x86_64.AppImage","format":"AppImage","minimum_system":"glibc 2.35 and Git 2.39","platform":"linux","sha256":"46a0da8c4fba1137d604713977ce9ba2e085805d9dd0a67e36a9d4698353f031","url":"https://github.com/devmil/gitlama/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.59-60/GitLama-0.1.0-beta.59-60-linux-x86_64.AppImage"},{"architecture":"x86_64","bytes":31363767,"file":"GitLama-0.1.0-beta.59-60-linux-x86_64.tar.gz","format":"tar.gz","minimum_system":"glibc 2.35 and Git 2.39","platform":"linux","sha256":"796c391ae4870a7589d61da488478712bf254eb877bdb1a1ecb5b36813c48807","url":"https://github.com/devmil/gitlama/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.59-60/GitLama-0.1.0-beta.59-60-linux-x86_64.tar.gz"},{"architecture":"arm64","bytes":33438152,"file":"GitLama-0.1.0-beta.59-60-macos-arm64.dmg","format":"dmg","minimum_system":"macOS 13.0 and Git 2.39","platform":"macos","sha256":"0a9c09ffaa2514c52b731eeaf33850ecb071f556b4e02b43a97618ffa4c00886","update_signature":"8u7Mpfz6QZBMDUv2pRYSnbJnrlwTGw6q2bfvijCKgTvI7KEt4EYSP6ejQtBuasp3yHnz/e0KsZBVEsIwSyifAg==","url":"https://github.com/devmil/gitlama/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.59-60/GitLama-0.1.0-beta.59-60-macos-arm64.dmg"},{"architecture":"x86_64","bytes":27279360,"file":"GitLama-0.1.0-beta.59-60-windows-x86_64.msi","format":"msi","minimum_system":"Windows 10 version 1809 and Git 2.39","platform":"windows","sha256":"dcbc9a3034ba30e01d1face683244833177c7a099bdc64ed6e1c8dc49d5669c1","url":"https://github.com/devmil/gitlama/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.59-60/GitLama-0.1.0-beta.59-60-windows-x86_64.msi"},{"architecture":"x86_64","bytes":31409178,"file":"gitlama-0.1.0-beta.59-60.x86_64.rpm","format":"rpm","minimum_system":"glibc 2.35 and Git 2.39","platform":"linux","sha256":"8fc169101f9a6d64bdde6c443b6bddb80128ed9a43dc66d9ae04035ec2f7dd08","url":"https://github.com/devmil/gitlama/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.59-60/gitlama-0.1.0-beta.59-60.x86_64.rpm"},{"architecture":"x86_64","bytes":31407906,"file":"gitlama_0.1.0-beta.59-60_amd64.deb","format":"deb","minimum_system":"glibc 2.35 and Git 2.39","platform":"linux","sha256":"67b98a1a2c5a853d50f1a5f7eaa89a3e78cb953b29c977a67fbd7fcbae2296de","url":"https://github.com/devmil/gitlama/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.59-60/gitlama_0.1.0-beta.59-60_amd64.deb"}],"build":60,"channel":"beta","notes":["The sidebar's Integrations section now shows whether CI passes on your repository's main branch, next to the linked hosting account. Hover the badge to see the branch and result.","Right after you push, a branch's pull request no longer stays marked as out of date with advice to fetch. GitLama now checks the pull request again shortly after, once the host has caught up with your push.","Escape now closes Settings right after you open them with Ctrl+, or Cmd+,.","In the conflict resolver, selected text in the Result stays visible over resolved conflicts. Each resolved block is now shaded across the whole line in the colour of the side it came from."],"tag":"v0.1.0-beta.59-60","version":"0.1.0-beta.59"},{"assets":[{"architecture":"x86_64","bytes":29997560,"file":"GitLama-0.1.0-beta.58-59-linux-x86_64.AppImage","format":"AppImage","minimum_system":"glibc 2.35 and Git 2.39","platform":"linux","sha256":"043ab66a2aa33c7be117b88d51a8228573841f876dd28cc8aa59707beb0bb30c","url":"https://github.com/devmil/gitlama/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.58-59/GitLama-0.1.0-beta.58-59-linux-x86_64.AppImage"},{"architecture":"x86_64","bytes":31360292,"file":"GitLama-0.1.0-beta.58-59-linux-x86_64.tar.gz","format":"tar.gz","minimum_system":"glibc 2.35 and Git 2.39","platform":"linux","sha256":"59ba63a80cb741c36bebcfe9e2ab199ecb583bd8c83db6d13841b381145ab532","url":"https://github.com/devmil/gitlama/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.58-59/GitLama-0.1.0-beta.58-59-linux-x86_64.tar.gz"},{"architecture":"arm64","bytes":33430003,"file":"GitLama-0.1.0-beta.58-59-macos-arm64.dmg","format":"dmg","minimum_system":"macOS 13.0 and Git 2.39","platform":"macos","sha256":"78faaeb1a9f06f01d81ca4cd2c89c673d44bdf9ecdeedbbb20338a1e63cd7313","update_signature":"Rit3SWnERyHNr2Q3/px4F7miN2RC3pOqAbqha12omhTKO40zqvk/CkhLR7mxcIUTXB1Q2VPr2rVBG3Zyb0F5Ag==","url":"https://github.com/devmil/gitlama/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.58-59/GitLama-0.1.0-beta.58-59-macos-arm64.dmg"},{"architecture":"x86_64","bytes":27271168,"file":"GitLama-0.1.0-beta.58-59-windows-x86_64.msi","format":"msi","minimum_system":"Windows 10 version 1809 and Git 2.39","platform":"windows","sha256":"e39bb44904b3010616bb9527a6dfa7926f9194400007371e807cdd10176d7b28","url":"https://github.com/devmil/gitlama/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.58-59/GitLama-0.1.0-beta.58-59-windows-x86_64.msi"},{"architecture":"x86_64","bytes":31399063,"file":"gitlama-0.1.0-beta.58-59.x86_64.rpm","format":"rpm","minimum_system":"glibc 2.35 and Git 2.39","platform":"linux","sha256":"0207e8b0e75947da900e458f6f55f5c026ec39d6b97cdc44a231c7d5c38699ee","url":"https://github.com/devmil/gitlama/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.58-59/gitlama-0.1.0-beta.58-59.x86_64.rpm"},{"architecture":"x86_64","bytes":31401200,"file":"gitlama_0.1.0-beta.58-59_amd64.deb","format":"deb","minimum_system":"glibc 2.35 and Git 2.39","platform":"linux","sha256":"1bff3cb8b07687a1cab9741e807dcdd12a1309143b4e95b6b87a8fc159441458","url":"https://github.com/devmil/gitlama/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.58-59/gitlama_0.1.0-beta.58-59_amd64.deb"}],"build":59,"channel":"beta","notes":["Dates in History are no longer cut off: dates such as \"Mon, Sep 28\" now show their day number.","Keep selecting files while GitLama stages or unstages changes, and queue more files without waiting for the first one. Pending files are marked, and you can cancel the waiting actions. GitLama shows whether it is waiting, checking changes, updating the index or refreshing the result. If staging cannot finish safely, it stops the waiting actions and tells you. Hosts receive a new GitLama helper.","The conflict resolver now guides you through each file. A step line at the top shows whether to pick changes, review the result, resolve the file or continue, says what to do next and counts the resolved files. Deleted files are marked in the file list, and after you resolve a file GitLama opens the next one and tells you which.","Resolving conflicts is clearer. When a file was deleted on one side, GitLama asks whether to keep the deletion or the file, highlights the side you picked, and shows that resolving will delete the file. You can take the choice back at any time. Once every file is resolved, the summary shows how each one was resolved, for example Deleted or Kept current version, so you can undo the right one before you continue.","Worktrees of one repository now share a single tab. When a repository has more than one worktree open, its tab shows how many, and a second row below the tabs lists each worktree by its branch, so you can switch, reorder or close them. The row also opens the repository's other worktrees or adds a new one, and it disappears again when only one worktree is left open.","Repositories on another computer can now use the hosting accounts configured on this computer. View pull requests, issues and checks, open reviews and provider pages, and choose an account in Settings → Repository link. GitLama contacts the provider from this computer; it needs network access and account permission there.","Upgrade Flutter to 3.47.8 to include the eMudhra certificate security fix in future builds.","The stage and unstage buttons that appear when you hover a changed file now use the same arrow as the toolbar's Stage selected and Unstage selected buttons, so they no longer look like Stage all and Unstage all."],"tag":"v0.1.0-beta.58-59","version":"0.1.0-beta.58"},{"assets":[{"architecture":"x86_64","bytes":29948408,"file":"GitLama-0.1.0-beta.57-58-linux-x86_64.AppImage","format":"AppImage","minimum_system":"glibc 2.35 and Git 2.39","platform":"linux","sha256":"a1f2a9a39b7526abde1b0fb7db0bc6eca244acb4f18dcab70ca4e9e687d9f913","url":"https://github.com/devmil/gitlama/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.57-58/GitLama-0.1.0-beta.57-58-linux-x86_64.AppImage"},{"architecture":"x86_64","bytes":31295779,"file":"GitLama-0.1.0-beta.57-58-linux-x86_64.tar.gz","format":"tar.gz","minimum_system":"glibc 2.35 and Git 2.39","platform":"linux","sha256":"ea135267993e6fca93cfcf7fba69de3be1bb049a8cf526367a76382cc886475d","url":"https://github.com/devmil/gitlama/releases/download/v0.