akes longer, the diff says it is waiting for Git and appears when Git answers, instead of reporting that it could not be loaded.","When checking a repository for changes is slow, GitLama offers to turn on Git's own speed-ups for it: the untracked cache and, on Windows and macOS, the file system monitor. Nothing changes until you choose Speed up.","Hosts receive a new GitLama helper."],"tag":"v0.1.0-beta.57-58","version":"0.1.0-beta.57"}],"schema_version":1,"trust":{"checksum":"sha256","manifest_signature":"Ed25519 detached signature over exact JSON bytes","signature_encoding":"base64"}}
